# T10i: the LIVE punch FX layer. FX held (or double-tapped) turns the first six lower (white) keys
# into the six punches and the first five upper (black) keys into role mutes; a tap latches, a hold
# is momentary; HOME+FX resets every effect and every mute; leaving LIVE releases them too. TFIXU 4:
# the keys are named by physical position, not by the chromatic raw index.
wait 300
# TCLS: the boot song is the Starter template, so DRUMS and BASS have clips.
# enter LIVE and start the transport with two clips playing.
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 50
expect mode 1
expect layer 0
tapkey 0
tapkey 7
tap PLAY
wait-bar 2
expect liveclip0 0
expect liveclip1 7

# --- FX held opens the layer; the six cells are drawn (LIVE 6) ---
press FX
wait 30
expect fxlayer 1
expect key w0 1
events live_fx_events.txt
wav live_fx.wav

# --- tap latches: repeat 1/8 (the first lower key) ---
tapkey w0
expect fxlatch0 1
expect key w0 2
# --- hold is momentary: tape stop (the third lower key; bright while held, dim after) ---
key w2 down
wait 350
expect key w2 2
expect fxlatch2 0
shot live_fx.png
key w2 up
wait 40
expect fxlatch2 0
expect key w2 1
# --- releasing FX returns to the layer underneath; a latched effect stays on ---
release FX
wait 40
expect fxlayer 0
expect fxlatch0 1

# --- HOME + FX resets every effect (and every mute) ---
press HOME
press FX
wait 40
release FX
release HOME
wait 40
expect fxlatch0 0
expect fxlatch1 0
expect fxlatch2 0

# --- the first five upper keys mute roles, through the clip engine ---
press FX
wait 30
expect fxlayer 1
tapkey b1
expect fxmute1 1
expect songrolemute1 0
expect key b1 2
tapkey b1
expect fxmute1 0
expect key b1 1
# --- leaving LIVE clears one latched effect and one mute ---
tapkey w1
tapkey b0
expect fxlatch1 1
expect fxmute0 1
release FX
wait 40
wavstop
eventsstop
dump live_fx.json
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
wait 60
expect mode 0
expect fxmute0 0
expect fxlatch1 0
